                <circle cx="370" cy="260" r="11" fill="#00BFA5" opacity="0.2"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Honest Fit Disclaimer -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="fit-disclaimer">
            <div class="fit-icon">💬</div>
            <div>
                <strong>An honest note about fit</strong>
                <p>DMD Inventory is not a full table-management or reservation system. There are no table maps, kitchen display screens, or tipping workflows built in. If those are essential to your operation, it may not be the right fit — and we'd rather tell you upfront than have you find out after signing up.</p>
                <p style="margin-top:0.5rem;">If you run a counter-service, takeout, café, or food retail operation — or if you need a solid POS + inventory layer without full hospitality features — DMD works very well.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Pain Points -->
<section class="sol-section sol-section--alt">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">Common problems we solve</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">Counter-service operations have specific inventory challenges.</h2>
        <div class="pain-grid">
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">🍱</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>No real-time ingredient tracking</strong>
                    <p>You sell out of an item but the POS doesn't know. Staff have to announce it over the counter.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Food cost is a black box</strong>
                    <p>You know revenue from the POS but can't see cost of goods, margins, or waste in the same system.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">📦</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Receiving is informal</strong>
                    <p>Supplier deliveries are scribbled on paper. There's no link between what you received and what you sold.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">🧾</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>End-of-day reconciliation takes too long</strong>
                    <p>Cash session closing, sales totals, tax summaries — everything done manually across separate tools.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">What DMD provides</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">Fast checkout, stock tracking, and daily financial clarity.</h2>
        <div class="sol-feat-grid">
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Fast POS Terminal</h3>
                <p>Product search, category browsing, quick add to cart. Cash and card payments. Print or skip receipts. Built for speed at the counter.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Menu Item Inventory</h3>
                <p>Track finished items as inventory units. Know exactly how many portions of each item are available before service begins.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Cash Session Management</h3>
                <p>Open sessions with an opening float. Close with a counted total. Discrepancies are flagged. Session history is always available for review.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Supplier Purchase Orders</h3>
                <p>Create POs for your food suppliers, receive deliveries, and track last purchase costs. Connect what you buy to what you sell.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Sales & Expense Reports</h3>
                <p>Daily revenue, expense tracking by category, and net income summaries. Understand profitability without a separate accounting system.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--purple">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Canadian Tax Built-In</h3>
                <p>GST and provincial taxes applied per item, per province. Tax summaries are always accurate — no manual tax calculations needed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Quote -->
<section class="sol-section sol-section--alt">
    <div class="sol-container sol-quote-wrap">
        <blockquote class="sol-quote sol-quote--purple">
            <p>"We run a takeout counter with about 30 menu items. DMD handles our POS, tracks daily stock, and gives us a clear picture of revenue vs. food costs. It's exactly what we needed — nothing more, nothing less."</p>
            <cite>— Quick-service counter owner, Quebec</cite>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- What's not included -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">Know before you start</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">Features NOT currently in DMD</h2>
        <div class="not-included-grid">
            <div class="not-card">
                <span class="not-x">✗</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Table management</strong>
                    <p>No floor plans, table assignment, or table-turn tracking.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="not-card">
                <span class="not-x">✗</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Kitchen display screens</strong>
                    <p>No KDS integration or order routing to kitchen stations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="not-card">
                <span class="not-x">✗</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Tipping workflow</strong>
                    <p>No tip prompts or tip distribution tracking.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="not-card">
                <span class="not-x">✗</span>
                <div>
                    <strong>Online ordering integration</strong>
                    <p>No direct connection to delivery platforms (Uber Eats, DoorDash).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="not-footer">If any of the above are critical for your operation, we recommend exploring dedicated hospitality platforms. We'd rather you make the right choice than sign up for something that doesn't fit.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Cross-links -->
<section class="sol-section sol-section--alt">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">Other industries</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">See how DMD fits your specific business type.</h2>
        <div class="cross-grid">
            <a href="/retail" class="cross-card">
                <div class="cross-icon">🏪</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Retail Stores</strong>
                    <span>General & specialty retail</span>
                </div>
                <svg class="cross-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/dry-goods" class="cross-card">
                <div class="cross-icon">🌾</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Nuts & Dry Goods</strong>
                    <span>Bulk & weight-based inventory</span>
                </div>
                <svg class="cross-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom CTA -->
<section class="sol-cta">
    <div class="sol-container sol-cta-inner">
        <h2>Think DMD is the right fit?</h2>
        <p>Try it free for 14 days. No credit card required. Cancel anytime.</p>
        <div class="sol-cta-buttons">
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">Talk to us first</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    :root {
        --purple: #7C3AED; --purple-dark: #4A148C; --purple-light: #EDE9FE;
        --teal: #00BFA5; --teal-dark: #00897B; --teal-light: #E0F7F4;
        --navy: #1A237E;
        --text: #1C1C1E; --text-muted: #6B7280;
        --border: #E5E7EB; --surface: #F9FAFB; --white: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .sol-hero {
        background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem;
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sol-hero::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 100%, rgba(124,58,237,0.06) 0%, transparent 65%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .sol-hero-inner { position: relative; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
    .sol-hero-copy { text-align: left; }
    .sol-hero-art { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
    @@media (max-width: 768px) { .sol-hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sol-hero-art { display: none; } }

    .sol-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .sol-eyebrow--purple { background: var(--purple-light); color: var(--purple-dark); border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.25); }
    .sol-eyebrow-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .sol-eyebrow-dot--purple { background: var(--purple); }

    .sol-title {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2.75rem;
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .sol-sub {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 2rem;
    }
    .sol-hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .sol-section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .sol-section--alt { background: var(--surface); }
    .sol-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .sol-label {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--purple-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .sol-heading {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; max-width: 640px;
    }

    /* Disclaimer */
    .fit-disclaimer {
        display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: flex-start;
        background: #FFFBEB; border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
        border-left: 4px solid #D97706;
        border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .fit-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .fit-disclaimer strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .fit-disclaimer p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    .pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .pain-card {
        display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;
        background: #FFF5F5; border: 1px solid #FECACA;
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .pain-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .pain-card strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pain-card p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

    .sol-feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .sol-feat-card {
        background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1.5rem; transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .sol-feat-card:hover { border-color: var(--purple); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124,58,237,0.1); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .sol-feat-icon {
        width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .sol-feat-icon--purple { background: var(--purple-light); color: var(--purple-dark); }
    .sol-feat-card h3 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .sol-feat-card p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    .sol-quote-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .sol-quote {
        max-width: 680px; border-left: 4px solid; padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; background: var(--white);
    }
    .sol-quote--purple { border-color: var(--purple); }
    .sol-quote p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-style: italic; }
    .sol-quote cite { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }

    /* Not included */
    .not-included-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .not-card {
        display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;
        background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .not-x { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #DC2626; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .not-card strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .not-card p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }
    .not-footer { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    .cross-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .cross-card {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
        background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .cross-card:hover { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,191,165,0.1); }
    .cross-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .cross-card div { flex: 1; }
    .cross-card strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
    .cross-card span { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .cross-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; }

    .sol-cta { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center; }
    .sol-cta-inner { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
